or medallion, or shall deny a license or medallion
application at renewal:
1. 6.311.260.F;
2. 6.311.270.A;
3. 6.311.310.B.1; and
4. 6.311.360.A.2;
H. The Director shall assess a $70 civil
penalty for the first offense and a $1,000 civil
penalty for the second and subsequent offenses of
Section 6.311.080;
